    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_02",
      "hash64": "7E32FF78B0575C08",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳已經在北上鄉捉到\\n１５０種以上的寶可夢啦！很有一套嘛～！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
