    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_09",
      "hash64": "7E32FA78B0575389",
      "text": "同學啊！\\n有時候繞點彎路也是很重要的喔！\\r\\n……所以呢，我還是要告訴[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_10",
      "hash64": "7E368778B05A78F7",
      "text": "我之所以來北上這裡，\\n是想要找到某隻寶可夢……\\r\\n然後拍下牠的照片。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
