        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_11",
      "hash64": "7E368678B05A7744",
      "text": "一直以來我都一個人在找牠，\\n但完～全找不到！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_12",
      "hash64": "7E368978B05A7C5D",
      "text": "……所以呢！同學[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要是\\n能幫我一起找的話，\\r\\n我會很～感謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 3,
